# Text files are checked out with LF on every platform, also on Windows with core.autocrlf=true:
# the tests compare the example mod folders byte for byte with their zips, and generated files
# (packages/mod-api, docs blocks) with what the generators write.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
